   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>量産機であそこまでできるのか。\nさすが一年戦争のエースパイロットだ…<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>To do that in a mass-production machine...\nHe truly is an ace from the One Year War...<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Tak Kepford."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#27",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(200)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>こんな戦術レベルの戦いの最中に何を！<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>What are you doing in the middle of a battle?!<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Amuro Ray."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#28",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(600)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>君も将校だろう！　ただの兵でないのなら、\n大局的にものを見ろ！<ab(600)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>You're an officer, aren't you! If you're no mere grunt,\ntake in the bigger picture!<ab(600)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Amuro Ray reprimanding Kou/Tak."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#29",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(300)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>は、はい！<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Y-Yes, sir!<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Kou / Tak."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#30",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(600)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>な…！　私は敵だぞ！<ab(600)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Wh-What...?! I am your enemy!<ab(600)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Gato baffled by Amuro scolding others."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#31",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>おのれ、このアナベル・ガトーは\n３年待ったのだ。<ab(400)>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Curse you! I, Anavel Gato,\nhave waited three long years!<ab(400)>",
   "notes": "Anavel Gato (0083 quote)."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#32",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(500)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>貴様たちのような分別のない者どもに\n我々の理想を邪魔されてたまるか！<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>I will never let mindless fools like you\nstand in the way of our ideals!<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Anavel Gato."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#33",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(100)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>我々の理想…？<ab(100)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Our ideals...?<ab(100)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Tak Kepford."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#34",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>我々はスペースノイドの真の解放を\n掴み取るのだ。<ab(400)>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>We shall seize the true liberation\nof Spacenoids!<ab(400)>",
   "notes": "Anavel Gato."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#35",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(600)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>悪しき呪縛を、我が正義の剣によってな！<ab(600)><ed()>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>Severing the wicked curse with my sword of justice!<ab(600)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Anavel Gato."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#36",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(200)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>…解放？　何を？<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>...Liberation? From what?<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Tak Kepford."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#37",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(200)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>アナベル・ガトー、ソロモンの悪夢…<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Anavel Gato, the Nightmare of Solomon...<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Tak Kepford."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#38",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(700)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>…できる！\n腐ったＵＣＥにもこのような者がいるとは！<ab(700)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>...Impressive!\nTo think the rotten UCE has someone like this!<ab(700)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Anavel Gato acknowledging player/Amuro."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#39",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(300)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>ヘッヘッヘッヘッヘ、始めるか！<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Heh heh heh heh heh, shall we get started?!<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Gon Jem."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#40",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(300)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>けっ！　いけすかねえ野郎だ！<ab(300)>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Pah! What an irritating bastard!<ab(300)>",
   "notes": "Gon Jem."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#41",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(500)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>まあいい！　\nＵＣＥのアホども！　かかってきやがれ！<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>Whatever!\nCome and get it, you UCE morons!<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Gon Jem."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#42",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>それじゃ、片付けてやるとしようか。<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Well then, let's take care of them.<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Tak / Amuro."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#43",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(200)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>気をつけて！　あいつらは手強いわ！<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Be careful! Those guys are tough!<ab(200)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Linda Plato."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#44",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>わかってる！　心配すんなよ、リンダちゃん！<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>I know! Don't you worry, Linda!<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Kaine Wakaba."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#45",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(700)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>２号機は他の奴に任せろ。\n今は目の前の敵に集中するんだ。<ab(700)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Leave Unit 2 to the others.\nRight now, focus on the enemies before you.<ab(700)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Amuro Ray / Burning."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#46",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>へっ！　思ったより手ごたえのねえ奴だ！<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Heh! That went down easier than I thought!<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Gon Jem / Kaine."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#47",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(100)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>ケーン！！<ab(100)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Kaine!!<ab(100)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Linda Plato."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#48",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(500)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>気をつけろ！　こいつは手強いぞ！<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Watch out! This one is tough!<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Tak / Light / Burning."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#49",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(500)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>ひゃひゃひゃ！　こいつぁ面白ぇや！<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Hyahyaha! Now this is fun!<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Gon Jem squad."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#50",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(500)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>調子に乗りすぎたね…今日はここまでだよ！<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Got carried away, huh... That's enough for today!<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Min."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#51",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(300)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>ちっ、これ以上はあぶねえな。\n野郎ども！　引き上げるぜ！<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Tch, any more of this is trouble.\nBoys! We're pulling out!<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Gon Jem."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#52",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(500)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>あたいは野郎じゃないよ！<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>I'm not one of the boys!<ab(500)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Min."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#53",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(700)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>周辺に敵影なし。　…２号機も見失いました。<ab(700)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>No enemy contacts nearby. ...We've lost Unit 2.<ab(700)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Operator."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#54",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(200)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>シナプス艦長、遅くなりました。<ab(200)>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Captain Sinapus, sorry to keep you waiting.<ab(200)>",
   "notes": "Amuro Ray."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#55",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(400)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>ラー・カイラムから一時転属になりました、\nアムロ・レイ大尉です。<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>I am Captain Amuro Ray, temporarily transferred\nfrom the Ra Cailum.<ab(400)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Amuro Ray."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#56",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(300)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>よく来てくれた。\nさすがはニュータイプのパイロットだな。<ab(300)>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Glad you made it.\nJust as I'd expect from a Newtype pilot.<ab(300)>",
   "notes": "Eyphar Sinapus."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#57",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(300)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>大尉がいなければ、２号機奪還どころか\nこの艦も危なかったところだ。<ab(300)>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>Without you, Captain, recovering Unit 2 aside,\neven this ship would have been in danger.<ab(300)>",
   "notes": "Eyphar Sinapus."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#58",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(600)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>着艦したら、ブリーフィングルームへ頼む。<ab(600)><ed()>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>Once you land, please report to the briefing room.<ab(600)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Eyphar Sinapus."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#59",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": true,
   "tokens": [
    "<op()>",
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(3000)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>モジュールが出現しました。<ab(3000)>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>A module has appeared.<ab(3000)>",
   "notes": "System/Operator."
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6022#60",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": 2,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(5000)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>ロックオンして接近することで、\nモジュールを取得することが可能です。<ab(5000)><ed()>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>You can acquire the module by locking on\nand approaching it.<ab(5000)><ed()>",
   "notes": "System/Operator."
  },
